## 🚀 Production Workflow (At a Glance)

```
STEP 1: BRIEFING
┗─ Share LOGO_FINAL_BRIEF.md with stakeholders
  ┗─ Confirm brand direction & mood
  
STEP 2: VECTOR DESIGN
┗─ Designer reads LOGO_VARIANT_SPECS.md for sizing/format
  ┗─ Creates Adobe Illustrator master file
  ┗─ Exports: .ai, .svg, PNG, EPS, PDF
  
STEP 3: 3D PRODUCTION
┗─ 3D artist reads 3D_CREATION_PROMPT.md
  ┗─ Creates Blender model using provided material node graph
  ┗─ Renders: 4K cosmic scene + product variants
  ┗─ Delivers: .blend, EXR, PNG, glb (web-optimized 3D)
  
STEP 4: ASSET MANAGEMENT
┗─ Organize using master file inventory structure
  ┗─ Run quality checklist (in LOGO_VARIANT_SPECS.md)
  ┗─ Test all formats and sizes
  
STEP 5: DISTRIBUTION
┗─ Web: SVG + PNG icon (512×512 px)
  ┗─ Mobile apps: Icon packages (all required sizes)
  ┗─ Print vendors: CMYK separations + TIFF
  ┗─ Marketing: 4K renders + all variants
  ┗─ Documentation: Watermark versions (low opacity)

DONE ✅
```

